    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d214">

                <pb facs="0280" n="188" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg188"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister Churchill to President
                        Roosevelt</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d214-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-11-12">12 November 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>No. 503. Prime Minister to President Roosevelt personal and most secret.</p>
                <list>
                    <item>Para 1. Reference your No. 417 of 11th November.<anchor n="2"
                            xml:id="d214-f2"/></item>
                    <item>Para 2. I have immediately telegraphed to General Auchinleck to render
                        every possible assistance in the constriction [<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >construction</hi>] of the four air bases.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d214-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d214-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to Washington by the American Embassy, London, apparently via military
                    channels, and forwarded by the White House Map Room by pouch on November 15,
                    1943; received by Roosevelt November 20 at Oran.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d214-f2" n="2" xml:id="d214-f2-content">
                <p>Message sent from Washington, November 10, 1943; <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg172">p. 172</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
